DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The rrttssxx driver provides support for the Realtek RTS5209, RTS5227,
     RTS5229, RTS522A, RTS5249, RTS525A, RTL8402, RTL8411, and RTL8411B SD
     card readers.

     The sdmmc(4) subsystem performs SD/MMC transactions to communicate with
     SD or SDHC devices inserted into the SD slot.

