     The rrttssxx driver first appeared in OpenBSD 5.3.

AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     The rrttssxx driver was written by Stefan Sperling <_s_t_s_p_@_o_p_e_n_b_s_d_._o_r_g>.

BBUUGGSS
     The rrttssxx driver does not support MS (Memory Stick) and xD (Extreme Digi‐
     tal) devices even though the hardware supports them.

     Support for SDIO interrupts is not implemented.

